{"id":"npc:%E5%BC%95%E7%81%AB%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%BB%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"死魂灵长者，卡兹戴尔最古老的护卫，实质的死魂灵王庭之主，寄宿在飞空艇核心中。九千年前成为死魂灵后各处收集同胞，将他们投入魂灵熔炉燃烧。在被击坠后意识清醒，成为维什戴尔的武器。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情14-17 核心舱攻防战、14-21 万千愿景等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_50_i12.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/d/d0/Avg_50_i12.png/240px-Avg_50_i12.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1340_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1340_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_1340_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[]}